        "node_id": "n_1_39fe52",
        "thought_text": "Parse the input sentence into words and process each word individually according to the Nimionese rules. Start by identifying the first hard consonant for each word and then replace all subsequent hard consonants with this initial consonant. Handle special cases like 'Each' becoming 'Dach' separately. Finally, append the appropriate ending ('ah', 'oh', or 'uh') based on the last hard consonant in the word.",
