        "thought_text": "Develop a lookup table for quick conversion of characters. Map each possible starting letter to its nearest hard consonant and define a set of rules for replacing hard consonants in subsequent syllables. For appending endings, use conditional logic to determine whether to add 'ah', 'oh', or 'uh'. Process the input sentence by splitting it into words, applying the conversion rules, and then joining the converted words into a single string for the output.",
